\item[S1] ULAM.AI and the UnsolvedMath Contributors, UnsolvedMath, record 30001362 (OWR-4129-004). Catalogue curation under CC BY 4.0; definitions and English exposition added locally.
\url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/ulamai/UnsolvedMath}.
\item[S2] Mathematical Aspects of General Relativity (2009), Oberwolfach Reports, DOI 10.4171/owr/2009/46, pp. 2585--2646; official report source and mathematical context.
\url{https://doi.org/10.4171/owr/2009/46}.
\item[S3] Official EMS Press PDF of the same Oberwolfach report; PDF page 22.
\url{https://ems.press/content/serial-article-files/46246}.
\item[S4] Andreasson--Kunze--Rein, gravitational collapse; reference in the saved dated catalogue literature review.
\url{https://arxiv.org/abs/gr-qc/0812.1645}.
\end{itemize}
\label{end:30001362}

